\doTocEntry\toclof{1}{\csname a:TocLink\endcsname{1}{x1-14001r1}{}{\ignorespaces Phase Diagram. The $\ensuremath  {\Delta c^{\mathrm@@ {e}}=0}$ and $\ensuremath  {\Delta m^{\mathrm@@ {e}}=0}$ loci cross at the target; the stable arm through it is the consumption function, and the arrows show the direction of motion in each region. Drawn by the handout's \href  {https://github.com/llorracc/TractableBufferStock/blob/main/TractableBufferStock.ipynb}{notebook}; run it in your browser, with nothing to install, in \href  {https://intertemporal-choice.github.io/lite/notebooks/index.html?path=TractableBufferStock.ipynb}{JupyterLite}, or open it in \href  {https://colab.research.google.com/github/llorracc/TractableBufferStock/blob/main/TractableBufferStock.ipynb}{Colab} or \href  {https://mybinder.org/v2/gh/intertemporal-choice/intertemporal-choice.github.io/main?labpath=content/consumption/TractableBufferStock/TractableBufferStock.ipynb}{Binder}.}}{figure}\relax 
\doTocEntry\toclof{2}{\csname a:TocLink\endcsname{1}{x1-14004r2}{}{\ignorespaces The Consumption Function. The consumption function lies below the 45 degree line and below the perfect foresight consumption function $\cc@accent {"7016}{\mathrm@@ {c}}$, which it approaches as $m^{\mathrm@@ {e}}$ grows. Drawn by the handout's \href  {https://github.com/llorracc/TractableBufferStock/blob/main/TractableBufferStock.ipynb}{notebook}; run it in your browser, with nothing to install, in \href  {https://intertemporal-choice.github.io/lite/notebooks/index.html?path=TractableBufferStock.ipynb}{JupyterLite}, or open it in \href  {https://colab.research.google.com/github/llorracc/TractableBufferStock/blob/main/TractableBufferStock.ipynb}{Colab} or \href  {https://mybinder.org/v2/gh/intertemporal-choice/intertemporal-choice.github.io/main?labpath=content/consumption/TractableBufferStock/TractableBufferStock.ipynb}{Binder}.}}{figure}\relax 
